": 1, "unit": "mIU/L", "low": 0.4, "high": 4, "takenOn": "2026-10-02", "sources": [{"doc": "d2", "page": 3}]}], "flags": [{"kind": "missing", "textEn": "The ENT letter mentions a CT scan of the sinuses from July 2026. It was not uploaded.", "textAr": "تذكر رسالة عيادة الأنف صورة مقطعية للجيوب الأنفية من يوليو 2026، ولم تُرفع.", "sources": [{"doc": "d1", "page": 2}]}], "unreadable": [{"doc": "d3", "page": 2, "reason": "handwritten"}]}'::jsonb, pg_temp.si('2026-11-07T18:20:00Z'), null, null),
